WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.032
A hospital appointment, step by step. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:07.032 --> 00:00:12.408
We check in at reception with our name and our letter or message.

3
00:00:12.408 --> 00:00:18.840
We get a seat number or a waiting area. Waiting is part of it.

4
00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:24.192
If the wait is long, waiting somewhere quieter is allowed.

5
00:00:24.192 --> 00:00:29.784
Our name gets called. We go to the room they say.

6
00:00:29.784 --> 00:00:36.168
We talk with the doctor or nurse. Notes in our phone are allowed.

7
00:00:36.168 --> 00:00:41.280
We ask our questions. One at a time.

8
00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:46.728
We check out, book the next step if there is one, and leave.

9
00:00:46.728 --> 00:00:54.936
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

